<p>Podziemski signed his rookie contract on July 3, 2023, four years and <strong>$16.24m</strong>, fully guaranteed. Golden State exercised the club options on both the third and fourth seasons, each a day before the deadline.</p>
<p>On October 10, 2026 he signed a five-year extension worth <strong>$110m</strong> that runs from 2027-28 to 2031-32 and includes a trade bonus. The fifth season is a mutual option, so he could reach free agency in 2031 at 28 or in 2032 at 29.</p>

