<link rel="stylesheet" href="/_ported/08ba6176394a.css">
<div class="nf-stat"><div class="nf-label">Estimated Net Worth</div><div class="nf-value">$7M</div><div class="nf-rank">Estimated from career earnings</div></div><script src="/_ported/8334868131c3.js" is:inline></script>
</div>
</div><div class="bde-f-text-506-156 bde-f-text">
<p>Podziemski’s net worth is estimated at around <strong>$6.5m</strong>, derived from his <strong>$16.24m</strong> in career earnings. Nobody publishes a figure for a player in his fourth season.</p>
<p>Rookie contracts for picks in the late teens pay between <strong>$3m</strong> and <strong>$6m</strong> a year, so four seasons of it adds up to less than a single year of what the players above him on this roster earn. His <strong>$110m</strong> extension, which starts next season, is where the real money starts.</p>

